[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: <h3>New manuscript submission</h3>=0A<p><b>Name:</b> R Rajender </p>=0A<p><=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: b>Email:</b> rathodrajendar123@gmail.com</p>=0A<p><b>Affiliation:</b> Centr=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: al University of Rajasthan</p>=0A<p><b>Subject:</b> submission</p>=0A<p><b>=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: Article Synopsis:</b><br>Decentralization in India is constitutionally fram=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: ed as a mechanism to strengthen grassroots democracy and empower marginaliz=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: ed communities. However, its implementation in tribal regions reveals a far=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER:  more complex reality. This paper employs the =E2=80=9Cdecentralization con=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: tinuum=E2=80=9D to understand local governance as a dynamic process shaped =

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: by shifting power relations, socio-cultural norms, bureaucratic practices, =

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: and political mobilization, rather than as a fixed institutional arrangemen=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: t. Integrating interdisciplinary perspectives and secondary evidence, the s=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: tudy examines national trends in decentralization and employs the continuum=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER:  framework to assess Telangana=E2=80=99s conversion of Banjara Thanda into =

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: Gram Panchayats, with a focus on the contrasting experiences of Warangal an=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: d Khammam districts. The findings demonstrate that tribal Panchayats often =

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: operate within =E2=80=9Chybrid governance spaces=E2=80=9D, where customary =

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: institutions coexist with statutory bodies, and formal empowerment is media=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: ted by bureaucratic dependence and local social structures. While Panchayat=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER:  formation has expanded representation and improved access to welfare schem=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: es, substantive autonomy remains uneven and negotiated. The continuum frame=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: work thus offers a more accurate analytical lens for understanding tribal g=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: overnance, revealing decentralization as an evolving spectrum ranging from =

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: symbolic to partial to substantive empowerment. The study emphasizes the im=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: portance of context-sensitive policies that enhance institutional capacity,=

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER:  acknowledge customary institutions, and foster inclusive participation in =

[2025-11-24T11:10:03+00:00] SMTP[1] CLIENT -> SERVER: tribal regions.</p>

